Exod 7:1 , Moses and Aaron are encouraged to go again to Pharaoh;
Exod 7:7 , Their age;
Exod 7:8 , Aaron's rod is turned into a serpent;
Exod 7:11 , The sorcerers do the like; but their rods are swallowed up by Aaron's;
Exod 7:13 , Pharaoh's heart is hardened;
Exod 7:14 , God's message to Pharaoh;
Exod 7:19 , The river is turned into blood; and the consequent distress of the Egyptians.
